Source: pgq
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
