Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pgq3
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Generic queue for PostgreSQL
 PgQ provides transactional queueing and event processing in PostgreSQL.
